  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836188",
      "title": "Using the Browser Debugger & Breakpoints",
      "sourceHash": "5f0cb608932ef9ccbfbaca5ce989a6f85f7ab0e6d2aafba8aa3bfc9f8c693f8b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.6,
          "end": 2.67,
          "en": "So it's great that we were able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.67,
          "end": 5.04,
          "en": "to get rid of this error message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.04,
          "end": 7.38,
          "en": "but as I mentioned earlier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.38,
          "end": 10.86,
          "en": "not all errors lead to error messages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.86,
          "end": 15.003,
          "en": "You sometimes also have logical errors in your code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.96,
          "end": 18.78,
          "en": "For example, still here in this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.78,
          "end": 20.58,
          "en": "which I attached earlier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 23.85,
          "en": "if I change the initial investment to let's say 15,000",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.85,
          "end": 28.85,
          "en": "or anything else, you see that these numbers blow up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.49,
          "end": 33.12,
          "en": "There clearly seems to be some error here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.12,
          "end": 37.41,
          "en": "And finding this error can now be a bit trickier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.41,
          "end": 40.86,
          "en": "because there is no error message in the console.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.86,
          "end": 45.06,
          "en": "So how can we find and fix errors like this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.06,
          "end": 48.42,
          "en": "Well, when it comes to handling errors like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.42,
          "end": 53.22,
          "en": "as a first step, you should always try to think logically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.22,
          "end": 57.87,
          "en": "Which part of your code could be responsible for this error?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.87,
          "end": 62.4,
          "en": "And here for this error, it's worth noting that initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 62.4,
          "end": 66.69,
          "en": "if I reload this app, everything seems to work fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 66.69,
          "end": 70.14,
          "en": "So it seems unlikely that the error is coming",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 70.14,
          "end": 74.78999999999999,
          "en": "from this calculate investment results function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 74.78999999999999,
          "end": 78.45,
          "en": "The code here seems to work correctly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 78.45,
          "end": 80.46000000000001,
          "en": "because otherwise we wouldn't get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 80.46000000000001,
          "end": 82.533,
          "en": "the right output here initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.55,
          "end": 86.13,
          "en": "It also seems unlikely that the error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.13,
          "end": 88.62,
          "en": "is coming from the results component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.62,
          "end": 91.44,
          "en": "and maybe from creating the table data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.44,
          "end": 96.12,
          "en": "because, again, initially everything seems to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.12,
          "end": 100.05,
          "en": "It only breaks if we edit those values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.05,
          "end": 103.35,
          "en": "So therefore, it of course seems to be related",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.35,
          "end": 105.993,
          "en": "to us fetching the user input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 107.07,
          "end": 110.07,
          "en": "which technically happens in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 110.07,
          "end": 114.50999999999999,
          "en": "because we lifted this state that manages the user input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 114.50999999999999,
          "end": 118.62,
          "en": "up from the user input component to the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 118.62,
          "end": 122.4,
          "en": "Here in handle change, we're storing the entered value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 122.4,
          "end": 125.64,
          "en": "in this state object in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 125.64,
          "end": 127.68,
          "en": "And it looks like this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 127.68,
          "end": 130.68,
          "en": "is responsible for this error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 133.2,
          "en": "And therefore, what we might wanna do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.2,
          "end": 137.28,
          "en": "is take a look at that code at the point of time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 137.28,
          "end": 140.4,
          "en": "where it's being executed with the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 140.4,
          "end": 143.67000000000002,
          "en": "that are actually used during execution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
