          "end": 150.66,
          "en": "by going to the Sources tab there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 150.66,
          "end": 153.54,
          "en": "here in the Chrome DevTools for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 153.54,
          "end": 156.303,
          "en": "but all browsers should have a tab like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 157.53,
          "end": 161.49,
          "en": "And there, you'll see that under local host,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
