        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 167.94,
          "end": 170.913,
          "en": "Most importantly, there is a src folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 171.96,
          "end": 176.46,
          "en": "And what's happening here is that this project setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 176.46,
          "end": 181.29,
